        "name": "com.castsoftware.asmzos",
        "href": "AIP/extensions/com.castsoftware.asmzos"
    },
    "description": "This quality rule reports all z/OS Assembler Macros with no comments.\nA z/OS Assembler Macro is one .asmacro source file, or a source file whose first statement is MACRO. Its comment lines are the comment lines starting with '*' or '.*' and the lines holding remarks written after the operands of a statement.",
    "output": "This rule lists all undocumented z/OS Assembler Macros.\nIt provides the following information:\n- Macro full name",
    "rationale": "Maintainability of the code is facilitated if there is documentation in the code. This rule will ensure there are comments within the Macros.",
    "reference": "CWE-1053: Missing Documentation for Design\nhttps://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1053.html",
    "remediation": "Add comments into the Macros to explain their goal and how they work.",
    "total": "Number of z/OS Assembler Macros",
    "alternativeName": "Avoid Macros having a very low Comment/Code ratio (z/OS Assembler)",
